{"s":45,"v":[{"t":"Ḥā, Meem.","w":[["حمٓ","Ha Meem","hha-meem",""]]},{"t":"The revelation of the Book is from Allāh, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["تَنزِيلُ","(The) revelation","tanzīlu",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["مِنَ","(is) from","mina",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["ٱلْعَزِيزِ","the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزِ",130]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمِ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمِ",133]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, within the heavens and earth are signs for the believers.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","and the earth","wal-arḍi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","surely (are) Signs","laāyātin","",[["لَ",23],["ـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ",39]]],["لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","for the believers","lil'mu'minīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لْ",2],["مُؤْمِنِينَ",70]]]]},{"t":"And in the creation of yourselves and what He disperses of moving creatures are signs for people who are certain [in faith].","w":[["وَفِى","And in","wafī","",[["وَ",1],["فِى",14]]],["خَلْقِكُمْ","your creation","khalqikum","",[["خَلْقِ",236],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَمَا","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يَبُثُّ","He disperses","yabuthu",""],["مِن","of","min",""],["دَآبَّةٍ","(the) moving creatures","dābbatin",""],["ءَايَـٰتٌۭ","(are) Signs","āyātun",""],["لِّقَوْمٍۢ","for a people","liqawmin","",[["لِّ",8],["قَوْمٍۢ",38]]],["يُوقِنُونَ","who are certain","yūqinūna","",[["يُوقِنُ",750],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And [in] the alternation of night and day and [in] what Allāh sends down from the sky of provision [i.e., rain] and gives life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness and [in His] directing of the winds are signs for a people who reason.","w":[["وَٱخْتِلَـٰفِ","And (in the) alternation","wa-ikh'tilāfi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱخْتِلَـٰفِ",1033]]],["ٱلَّيْلِ","(of) the night","al-layli","",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","and the day","wal-nahāri","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["نَّهَارِ",219]]],["وَمَآ","and what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَنزَلَ","Allah sends down","anzala",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah sends down","l-lahu",""],["مِنَ","from","mina",""],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ","the sky","l-samāi","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["مِن","of","min",""],["رِّزْقٍۢ","(the) provision","riz'qin",""],["فَأَحْيَا","and gives life","fa-aḥyā","",[["فَ",7],["أَحْيَا",238]]],["بِهِ","thereby","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِ",5]]],["ٱلْأَرْضَ","(to) the earth","l-arḍa","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضَ",35]]],["بَعْدَ","after","baʿda",""],["مَوْتِهَا","its death","mawtihā","",[["مَوْتِ",246],["هَا",22]]],["وَتَصْرِيفِ","and (in) directing","wataṣrīfi","",[["وَ",1],["تَصْرِيفِ",2258]]],["ٱلرِّيَـٰحِ","(the) winds","l-riyāḥi","",[["ٱل",2],["رِّيَـٰحِ",387]]],["ءَايَـٰتٌۭ","(are) Signs","āyātun",""],["لِّقَوْمٍۢ","for a people","liqawmin","",[["لِّ",8],["قَوْمٍۢ",38]]],["يَعْقِلُونَ","who reason","yaʿqilūna","",[["يَعْقِلُ",250],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"These are the verses of Allāh which We recite to you in truth. Then in what statement after Allāh and His verses will they believe?","w":[["تِلْكَ","These","til'ka","",[["تِ",279],["لْ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ءَايَـٰتُ","(are the) Verses","āyātu",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["نَتْلُوهَا","We recite them","natlūhā","",[["نَتْلُو",203],["هَا",22]]],["عَلَيْكَ","to you","ʿalayka","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["كَ",18]]],["بِٱلْحَقِّ","in truth","bil-ḥaqi","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["حَقِّ",64]]],["فَبِأَىِّ","Then in what","fabi-ayyi","",[["فَ",7],["بِ",10],["أَىِّ",71]]],["حَدِيثٍۭ","statement","ḥadīthin",""],["بَعْدَ","after","baʿda",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","and His Verses","waāyātihi","",[["وَءَ",1],["ايَـٰتِ",39],["هِۦ",5]]],["يُؤْمِنُونَ","will they believe","yu'minūna","",[["يُؤْمِنُ",30],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Woe to every sinful liar","w":[["وَيْلٌۭ","Woe","waylun",""],["لِّكُلِّ","to every","likulli","",[["لِّ",8],["كُلِّ",43]]],["أَفَّاكٍ","liar","affākin",""],["أَثِيمٍۢ","sinful","athīmin",""]]},{"t":"Who hears the verses of Allāh recited to him, then persists arrogantly as if he had not heard them. So give him tidings of a painful punishment.","w":[["يَسْمَعُ","Who hears","yasmaʿu",""],["ءَايَـٰتِ","(the) Verses","āyāti",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["تُتْلَىٰ","recited","tut'lā",""],["عَلَيْهِ","to him","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["ثُمَّ","then","thumma",""],["يُصِرُّ","persists","yuṣirru",""],["مُسْتَكْبِرًۭا","arrogantly","mus'takbiran",""],["كَأَن","as if","ka-an",""],["لَّمْ","not","lam",""],["يَسْمَعْهَا","he heard them","yasmaʿhā","ۖ",[["يَسْمَعْ",160],["هَا",22]]],["فَبَشِّرْهُ","So give him tidings","fabashir'hu","",[["فَ",7],["بَشِّرْ",318],["هُ",5]]],["بِعَذَابٍ","(of) a punishment","biʿadhābin","",[["بِ",10],["عَذَابٍ",48]]],["أَلِيمٍۢ","painful","alīmin",""]]},{"t":"And when he knows anything of Our verses, he takes them in ridicule. Those will have a humiliating punishment.","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["عَلِمَ","he knows","ʿalima",""],["مِنْ","of","min",""],["ءَايَـٰتِنَا","Our Verses","āyātinā","",[["ءَايَـٰتِ",39],["نَا",11]]],["شَيْـًٔا","anything","shayan",""],["ٱتَّخَذَهَا","he takes them","ittakhadhahā","",[["ٱتَّخَذَ",114],["هَا",22]]],["هُزُوًا","(in) ridicule","huzuwan","ۚ"],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","Those ","ulāika","",[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["عَذَابٌۭ","(is) a punishment","ʿadhābun",""],["مُّهِينٌۭ","humiliating","muhīnun",""]]},{"t":"Before them is Hell, and what they had earned will not avail them at all nor what they had taken besides Allāh as allies. And they will have a great punishment.","w":[["مِّن","Before them","min",""],["وَرَآئِهِمْ","Before them","warāihim","",[["وَرَآئِ",450],["هِمْ",3]]],["جَهَنَّمُ","(is) Hell","jahannamu","ۖ"],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["يُغْنِى","will avail","yugh'nī",""],["عَنْهُم","them","ʿanhum","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُم",3]]],["مَّا","what","mā",""],["كَسَبُوا۟","they had earned","kasabū","",[["كَسَبُ",201],["وا۟",3]]],["شَيْـًۭٔا","anything","shayan",""],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","they had taken","ittakhadhū","",[["ٱتَّخَذُ",114],["وا۟",3]]],["مِن","besides","min",""],["دُونِ","besides","dūni",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَوْلِيَآءَ","(as) protectors","awliyāa","ۖ"],["وَلَهُمْ","And for them","walahum","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["عَذَابٌ","(is) a punishment","ʿadhābun",""],["عَظِيمٌ","great","ʿaẓīmun",""]]},{"t":"This [Qur’ān] is guidance. And those who have disbelieved in the verses of their Lord will have a painful punishment of foul nature.","w":[["هَـٰذَا","This","hādhā","",[["هَ",0],["ـٰذَا",69]]],["هُدًۭى","(is) guidance","hudan","ۖ"],["وَٱلَّذِينَ","And those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","in (the) Verses","biāyāti","",[["بِ",10],["ـَٔايَـٰتِ",39]]],["رَبِّهِمْ","(of) their Lord","rabbihim","",[["رَبِّ",24],["هِمْ",3]]],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["عَذَابٌۭ","(is) a punishment","ʿadhābun",""],["مِّن","of","min",""],["رِّجْزٍ","filth","rij'zin",""],["أَلِيمٌ","painful","alīmun",""]]},{"t":"It is Allāh who subjected to you the sea so that ships may sail upon it by His command and that you may seek of His bounty; and perhaps you will be grateful.","w":[["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","al-lahu",""],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["سَخَّرَ","subjected","sakhara",""],["لَكُمُ","to you","lakumu","",[["لَ",8],["كُمُ",4]]],["ٱلْبَحْرَ","the sea","l-baḥra","",[["ٱلْ",2],["بَحْرَ",292]]],["لِتَجْرِىَ","that may sail","litajriya","",[["لِ",8],["تَجْرِىَ",214]]],["ٱلْفُلْكُ","the ships","l-ful'ku","",[["ٱلْ",2],["فُلْكُ",459]]],["فِيهِ","therein","fīhi","",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["بِأَمْرِهِۦ","by His Command","bi-amrihi","",[["بِ",10],["أَمْرِ",82],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","and that you may seek","walitabtaghū","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["تَبْتَغُ",350],["وا۟",4]]],["مِن","of","min",""],["فَضْلِهِۦ","His Bounty","faḍlihi","",[["فَضْلِ",149],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","and that you may","walaʿallakum","",[["وَ",1],["لَعَلَّ",109],["كُمْ",4]]],["تَشْكُرُونَ","give thanks","tashkurūna","",[["تَشْكُرُ",263],["ونَ",4]]]]},{"t":"And He has subjected to you whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth - all from Him. Indeed in that are signs for a people who give thought.","w":[["وَسَخَّرَ","And He has subjected","wasakhara","",[["وَ",1],["سَخَّرَ",474]]],["لَكُم","to you","lakum","",[["لَ",8],["كُم",4]]],["مَّا","whatever","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth ","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["جَمِيعًۭا","all","jamīʿan",""],["مِّنْهُ","from Him","min'hu","ۚ",[["مِّنْ",6],["هُ",5]]],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","surely are Signs","laāyātin","",[["لَ",23],["ـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ",39]]],["لِّقَوْمٍۢ","for a people","liqawmin","",[["لِّ",8],["قَوْمٍۢ",38]]],["يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","who give thought","yatafakkarūna","",[["يَتَفَكَّرُ",582],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], to those who have believed that they [should] forgive those who expect not the days of Allāh [i.e., of His retribution] so that He may recompense a people for what they used to earn.","w":[["قُل","Say","qul",""],["لِّلَّذِينَ","to those who","lilladhīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لَّذِينَ",17]]],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["يَغْفِرُوا۟","(to) forgive","yaghfirū","",[["يَغْفِرُ",192],["وا۟",3]]],["لِلَّذِينَ","those who","lilladhīna","",[["لِ",8],["لَّذِينَ",17]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يَرْجُونَ","hope","yarjūna","",[["يَرْجُ",481],